1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,198
Engineering ki, par company wale kehte hain experience laao.

2
00:00:04,498 --> 00:00:09,650
Kunal, experience khud bana! 3D printer le, kuch bhi print karke bech!

3
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:12,231
Mama ji, 3D print se kya bikega?

4
00:00:12,531 --> 00:00:18,538
Naam wale keychain, khilone, murtiyan, machine ke purze. Do printer, 60 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:18,838 --> 00:00:24,446
College ke project aur dukaanon ke logo bhi bana. Instagram pe order lena.

6
00:00:24,996 --> 00:00:29,760
Bhaiya, bete ke birthday pe uska favourite superhero chahiye, uske naam ke saath!

7
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,523
Kal tak taiyaar, didi! 500 rupaye.

8
00:00:32,823 --> 00:00:38,339
Ek gift ki laagat 100 rupaye. Roz 4-5 order, mahine ke 40 hazaar.

9
00:00:38,639 --> 00:00:43,966
Phir factoriyon ke toote purze print kar. Wahan ek piece hazaaron ka bikta hai.

10
00:00:44,266 --> 00:00:47,092
Jo socho, wo chhaapo! Kunal ki life set!
